ve at 0.6x net debt to EBITDA ($4.5M of cash against $167.8M of debt), with interest covered 7.9x.","Short-term liquidity is ample (current ratio 3.34).","Working capital ties up about 182 days of sales, a drag on cash generation."],"growth":["Net reinvestment is nil (capex and working capital no more than cover depreciation), so fundamental growth is near zero.","Capex roughly matches depreciation (0.9x, 16.8% of sales), a maintenance pace.","It has beaten earnings estimates by 112.8% on average.","Analysts expect 12.2% long-term annual earnings growth."],"own":["Insiders own a modest 3.3%, and institutions hold 100%.","Insider trading is two-way: 1 purchase and 16 sales over the past year, net $192.5M sold.","It returns 2.6% a year to shareholders (0.8% in buybacks and 1.8% in dividends)."],"people":["With about 1,281 employees, each generates about $593K of revenue, 0.3x the Energy median.","That works out to $130K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $3.8M (6x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores poorly (8/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $9K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"WATCH","conv":79,"head":"Watch: heavy insider selling ($192.5M net over 12 months).","pros":["Trades 22% below fair value of $25.62","ROIC 38.0% vs WACC 9.8%","FCF margin 22.0%","Net debt/EBITDA 0.6x","Altman Z in the safe zone"],"cons":["Heavy insider selling ($192.5M net over 12 months)","Flag: thin EDGAR history (1y)"],"flags":[],"need":["the model rates it HOLD"],"buy_below":21.78,"vc":{"base":25.62,"base_src":"dcf","bear":20.68,"bull":32.38,"alt_median":24.11,"n_alt":2,"gap":0.0626,"dispersion":0.0986,"level":"HIGH","why":[]},"med":{"pe":13.3952,"ev_ebitda":6.86,"pfcf":14.299,"pb":1.6885,"roic":0.0952,"gross_margin":0.2462,"fcf_margin":0.0754,"div_yield":0.0371}},"ticker":"FLOC","date":"2026-11-06"}